<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) has issued 500,000 European-style warrants, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager BfG Bank AG, Frankfurt said.</p>
<p> PERIOD			   RANGES</p>
<p> 22.NOV.96-23.FEB.97	  31.00-35.00</p>
<p> 24.FEB.97-25.MAY.97	  30.50-35.50</p>
<p> 26.MAY.97-24.AUG.97	  30.00-36.00</p>
<p> 25.AUG.97-24.NOV.97	  29.50-36.50</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE 24.NOV.97  PAYDATE 06.DEC.96  ISS PRICE 7.35 DEM</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  32.00</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
